+- **No Unused Locals:** Enforced
+- **No Unused Parameters:** Enforced
+- **Path Aliases:** `@/` → `./src/`
+
+### Component Props
+
+All component props use TypeScript interfaces:
+
+```typescript
+interface Props {
+  data: Asset[]
+  loading: boolean
+}
+
+const props = defineProps<Props>()
