+| Deep Analytics | ✅ | ⚠️ (Basic) |
+| Privacy | ✅ (Your data) | ❌ (Platform data) |
+| Customization | ✅ | ❌ |
+| Cost | Free | Subscription-based |
+| Learning Curve | Low | Medium |
+
+**Why Financing Wins:** Consolidated view, privacy, and cost
+
+---
